Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71687,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7ae8b0f8e3b968040359dc520ec4060","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Johanna =-)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I did see on a review not to long ago about the photo booth and i heard that Dino Gomez supplied them with a photo booth for there wedding in Dreams. =-) I hope that helps you =-)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats on your engagement!! Wish you nothing but the best =-D&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tania&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1758607,"PostDate":1368742636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Johanna =-)\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did see on a review not to long ago about the photo booth and i heard that Dino Gomez supplied them with a photo booth for there wedding in Dreams. =-) I hope that helps you =-)\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats on your engagement!! Wish you nothing but the best =-D<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Tania\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"molinatania24@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.0.16.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1337193895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255471.jpg?_r=1404934311","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SweetT","Id":255471,"Name":"SweetT","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71687,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c944d10e7f126d45d29c3de748f2709f","RawContent":"This thread is so helpful, ladies! Thank you all. I&#039;ve been trying to think of how to save money but still get the pics I want. This all sounds wonderful.","Attachments":[],"Id":1776391,"PostDate":1373315737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This thread is so helpful, ladies! Thank you all. I've been trying to think of how to save money but still get the pics I want. This all sounds wonderful.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"b_mustone@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371056910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270527.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BeckaThomas","Id":270527,"Name":"BeckaThomas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.161.51.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71687,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5caca89895a90e0923b9f822104c3ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You need to look at Jorge Ibarra for video! Amazing job we absolutely love our video.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829695,"PostDate":1391003761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You need to look at Jorge Ibarra for video! Amazing job we absolutely love our video.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellewilbur@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.161.51.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325078119,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248997.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":104,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mlw02","Id":248997,"Name":"mlw02","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.231.102.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71687,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fd4e8634530bf13193a18f117466318","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SweetT\" post=\"1702670\" timestamp=\"1357682757\"]\nHi I was just wondering if any of the fellow brides can probably recommend me a Photographer and Videographer PLEASE!!! I have booked everything else for my wedding but for some reason I&#039;m just so confused on what Photographer and Videographer to choose from. I have contacted two and OMG I had no clue how pricey they are going to be!! I guess which is ok because that is a very important of the wedding. But i still don&#039;t want to pay an arm or leg either LOL I was also wondering if anyone used the in house photographer and videographer from Dreams. If so how were they? Thank you so much in advance for any help you guys can give me \n\n\n\nTania[\/quote]\n\nI found a husband and wife team and they are $1,200 and you get both of them plus they pay their own way to your destination wedding. You should check them out Kevin and Christine photography","Attachments":[],"Id":1829970,"PostDate":1391080778,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SweetT, on 08 January 2013 - 06:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi I was just wondering if any of the fellow brides can probably recommend me a Photographer and Videographer PLEASE!!! I have booked everything else for my wedding but for some reason I'm just so confused on what Photographer and Videographer to choose from. I have contacted two and OMG I had no clue how pricey they are going to be!! I guess which is ok because that is a very important of the wedding. But i still don't want to pay an arm or leg either LOL I was also wondering if anyone used the in house photographer and videographer from Dreams. If so how were they? Thank you so much in advance for any help you guys can give me\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tania\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found a husband and wife team and they are $1,200 and you get both of them plus they pay their own way to your destination wedding. You should check them out Kevin and Christine photography\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382024686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.176.67.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71687,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76547701ff3ab8501f41e9e78d9600ec","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hello!!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Here you can see a small wedding I had recently with an amazing couple:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremy&#039;&gt;www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremyhttp:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremy&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I hope you can get any good idea from these pictures. Happy planning!!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Gonzalo Verdeja&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914056,"PostDate":1464351150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hello!!<\/div>\n<div>Here you can see a small wedding I had recently with an amazing couple:<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremy' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremyhttp:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/dreams-los-cabos-wedding-lacey-jeremy<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I hope you can get any good idea from these pictures. Happy planning!!<\/div>\n<div>Gonzalo Verdeja<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258572501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
